    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the social services law, in relation to establishing a certificate of need process for the assisted living program; and to establish a moratorium on the authorization of new assisted living programs in certain cases",
    "basePrintNo": "S5840",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5840-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
